     "Doing test-unit with clang++ (only), I immediately get<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">clang</span><span style=\"color:#660\">++</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I src </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I lib</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">eigen_3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I lib</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">boost_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">53.0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Wall</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DBOOST_RESULT_OF_USE_TR1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DBOOST_NO_DECLTYPE </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DBOOST_DISABLE_ASSERTS </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Wno</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">unused</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Wno</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">uninitialized   </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">O3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DGTEST_HAS_PTHREAD</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#0